<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Jan-Jul global trade deficit 821 bln esc.</title>
<headline>Portugal Jan-Jul global trade deficit 821 bln esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's global trade deficit fell to 821 billion escudos between January and July from 916 billion in same period last year, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.  </p>
<p>		  Jan-Jul 96    Jan-Jul 95   July 96   June 96</p>
<p> Overall balance  -821.3     -916.4	-98.0   -105.5</p>
<p> Imports	     3,024.5    2,971.2     439.3    393.9</p>
<p> Exports	     2,203.2    2,054.9     341.9    288.4</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in billions of escudos. A minus sign denotes a deficit. 1995 figures are definitive while 1996 figures are preliminary.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
